# Code HTML:
<table>
  <tr> <th>Tên</th> <th>Địa chỉ</th> <th>Thành phố</th> </tr>
  <tr> <td>Nguyễn văn A</td> <td>123 Đường ABC</td> <td>TP.HCM</td> </tr>
  <tr> <td>Trần văn B</td> <td>456 Đường XYZ</td> <td>Hà Nội</td> </tr>
